===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*terh₁-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|returnen}}, {{m|enm|retornen}}, from {{der|en|xno|returner}}, from {{der|en|fro|retourner}}, {{m|fro|retorner}}, from {{der|en|la-med|retornare||to turn back}}, from {{m|la|re-}} + {{m|la|tornare||to turn}}. {{surf|en|re-|turn}}. Compare {{m|en|beturn}}. Displaced native {{noncog|ang|geċierran}} and {{noncog|ang|bugan}}.

